Package: scdbayes
Title: Bayesian Single-Case Design Analysis
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Mikyung", "Shin", , "shin.mikyung@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7907-9193"))
Description: Provides a Bayesian multilevel modeling workflow for
    single-case designs via 'brms' and 'Stan'. Includes
    piecewise regression with random effects, posterior-based effect
    sizes, cross-case consistency estimates, support for AB, reversal,
    multiple baseline, multiple probe, alternating treatment, and
    changing criterion designs, two- to four-level hierarchical structures
    for single-study and meta-analytic data, and an interactive 'Shiny'
    interface for data upload, model specification, diagnostics, and
    export of reproducible scripts and reports.
